This repository redistributes modified copies of CustomResourceDefinition
manifests from the following upstream projects. Each chart directory contains
the upstream LICENSE, a NOTICE stating the pinned tag/commit and the
modifications made, and attribution in its README.

- external-dns-crds: CRDs from https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/external-dns (Apache-2.0)
- external-secrets-crds: CRDs from https://github.com/external-secrets/external-secrets (Apache-2.0)
- gateway-api-crds: CRDs from https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/gateway-api (Apache-2.0)
- gateway-api-exp-crds: CRDs from https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/gateway-api (Apache-2.0)
